W4 plain-glibc placement NEGATIVE — 2026-11-24 04:30Z, author measurement only.
Scope: pinned v6.0.6 glTF-only minimal plain build in build-min-plain (the
build used by harness/run-placement.sh). Probe source: harness/placement_probe.cpp.
No library, harness or tracked case file was changed by this probe.

Compile (from lab/frontier/assimp2shell):
g++ -O1 -g0 -I pins/assimp-6.0.6/include -I build-min-plain/include \
    harness/placement_probe.cpp -L build-min-plain/bin -lassimp \
    -Wl,-rpath,"$PWD/build-min-plain/bin" -o /tmp/assimp-w4/probe

Case recipe (all VEC4 count=2 documents 509 bytes, same template, so the
allocation sequence is not changed by JSON length):
  buffer 32 bytes = float32 LE element0 (0,0,1.0,1.25) + element1 (0,0,1.0,wbits)
  accessor componentType 5126, count 2, type VEC4; wbits varied below.
Matched VEC3 baseline: same 32-byte buffer and same 509-byte JSON with
"type":"VEC3" (only first 24 bytes consumed), so no overflow.

