The failing allocation is a later 8-byte operator new inside ImportMeshes,
not a free of the vertex array; the damaged heap metadata is observed while
the importer continues after the overflow.

=== disposition ===
NEGATIVE, preserved: no chosen value reaches a live aiMesh field, no clean
import control was found, and no grooming was attempted. The VEC4 POSITION
path is structurally limited to the next chunk's size field on this host's
glibc. This does NOT downgrade the rung-4 ASan/placement findings (they are
about the importer's own write); it closes this placement extension as a
